{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">菲律賓餐飲龍頭「快樂蜂」放棄到美國上市計劃，改為分拆國際業務來港，在港交所主板掛牌。集團認為有助開拓內地及海外市場。菲律賓政府亦鼓勵當地更多企業去香港找商機。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"PHIL.CHICKEN 1.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Fv0W9Xo6tc1790346567.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"PHIL.CHICKEN 1.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"PHIL.CHICKEN 3.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026hHOi71EhgE1790346585.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"PHIL.CHICKEN 3.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在菲律賓，總有隻「蜜蜂」在附近。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"PHIL.CHICKEN 4.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Pm2G88Y5GE1790346597.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"PHIL.CHICKEN 4.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">「快樂蜂」由華裔商人陳覺中創立，賣雪糕起家，再轉型為快餐店。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"PHIL.CHICKEN 8.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026pUgSmYN6X51790346627.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"PHIL.CHICKEN 8.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"PHIL.CHICKEN 10.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20269FG0UgXVn11790346646.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"PHIL.CHICKEN 10.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"PHIL.CHICKEN 9.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026713EtFrWEv1790346638.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"PHIL.CHICKEN 9.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">招牌是炸雞、漢堡，還賣飯及意粉，很受菲律賓人歡迎。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"PHIL.CHICKEN 2.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Dw7V02826T1790346576.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"PHIL.CHICKEN 2.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">這間連鎖快餐店在香港被視為菲傭聚腳地。在大本營菲律賓，就可以說是潮流聖地，光顧的以年輕人為主。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"PHIL.CHICKEN 12.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20269zAmQ4TkVZ1790346671.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"PHIL.CHICKEN 12.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">「快樂蜂」早在90年代來港發展，近年不斷收購世界各地不同類型餐飲品牌，包括香港點心店，中式快餐及茶飲店等，打造為國際飲食品牌。已擴展到一萬多間分店，海外佔六成多。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"PHIL.CHICKEN 5.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026B0yTP8h19b1790346604.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"PHIL.CHICKEN 5.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">他們年初時計劃分拆國際業務，到美國第二上市。最新決定「轉跑道」，來港主板上市，以香港做跳板，拓展北美等海外市場。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"PHIL.CHICKEN 11.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20264ua7KLs1XY1790346655.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"PHIL.CHICKEN 11.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">快樂蜂國際行政總裁Richard Shin表示：「我們矢志走向國際市場，香港有完善基建，是良好的人才庫，亦非常支持企業發展，容許我們既紮根香港，同時能把握海外機遇。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"PHIL.CHICKEN  12.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026UGL3syAPn01790346688.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"PHIL.CHICKEN  12.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">環球經濟不景氣，集團相信有危就有機。又希望借助香港經驗，進軍中國內地尤其大灣區市場。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Richard Shin認為：「任何從事餐飲業的人，都要認真考慮在中國的市場策略，這裡蘊藏著機遇，我們會謹慎行事，因為競爭非常激烈。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"PHIL.CHICKEN 13.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Suluju59GR1790346663.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"PHIL.CHICKEN 13.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Jollibee快樂蜂目標成為繼麥當勞、肯德基後，世界第三大連鎖餐飲品牌。集團預計明年一半收入，來自菲律賓以外的海外分店。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"PHIL.CHICKEN 14.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026bEJaCX2a0Y1790347110.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"PHIL.CHICKEN 14.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">近年來港發展的東盟國家企業越來越多，菲律賓政府亦鼓勵更多中小微企到香港探索商機。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">菲律賓貿工部海外貿易服務主任羅拔圖稱：「香港作為『超級聯繫人』，是東盟商家進入中國內地很好的一塊跳板，可以先試水溫，再拓展內地市場。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">他相信菲律賓食品，例如紫薯及牛油果，在香港與內地都會有市場。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"PHIL.CHICKEN 15.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026p6f7JKDlz91790347128.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"PHIL.CHICKEN 15.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-27T00:57:56.438348+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":737,"images":14,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}